        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">Analytics separate creators who guess from creators who know. When you can tell a brand that your talking-head format averages a 45% <a href="/hook-rate" class="text-accent hover:underline">hook rate</a> compared to 25% for testimonials, you are not just a content producer &mdash; you are a strategic partner. Brands pay more for creators who understand performance because those creators produce content that converts.</p>

